# Fallback for BOTH deploy/nas/*/Dockerfile under the legacy builder (DOCKER_BUILDKIT=0). BuildKit
# reads the Dockerfile.dockerignore next to each Dockerfile instead. So this is the union both
# images tolerate: it keeps public/ and src/ (the admin image copies them; rr-api copies named
# directories only, so they cost it nothing). Keep the three in sync.
.git
.github
.claude
.wrangler
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.dev.vars
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-shm
**/*.sqlite-wal
**/*.log
docs
plans
tests
tools
README.md
*.md
# Local harness output and design scratch (untracked, hundreds of MB): never build context.
.local
.superdesign
